格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"SSH remote-execution plugin for DeepSeek Harness: ProxyJump chain, SFTP filesystem, subprocess and PTY over ssh2","id":"gh:1333157512","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-ssh","slug":"UynajGI/dsh-ssh","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","plugin","proxyjump","remote-development","sftp","ssh"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"SSH remote-execution plugin for DeepSeek Harness: ProxyJump chain, SFTP filesystem, subprocess and P"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"xecution plugin for DeepSeek Harness: ProxyJump chain, SFTP filesystem, subprocess and PTY over ssh2"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-ssh"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**SSH remote-execution plugin for DeepSeek Harness.** Runs Bash, file tools, PTY terminals and LSP o"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"n a remote host over one SSH connection — ProxyJump chains, SFTP, full auth. Built on ssh2."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Or use the Web UI: **Plugins → Add plugin → `dsh-ssh`**. The bundle mounts the SSH providers and tak"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"es over the **Add workspace** flow — create real connections there. Needs DeepSeek Harness 0.2.x and"},{"id":"p7s3","text":" **Add workspace** flow — create real connections there. Needs DeepSeek Harness 0.2.x and Node ≥ 22."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"A plain `npm i dsh-ssh` does not select the bundle; add it to `dsh.profile.bundles` yourself."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Configure"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Only needed when composing providers by hand (`cordis.yml`):"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| Field | Default | Notes |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| `host` `username` `cwd` | — | required (`cwd` is an absolute POSIX path) |\n| `port` | 22 | |\n| `pa"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ssword` `privateKey` `passphrase` `agent` | — | any auth mode; falls back to `~/.ssh` identities |\n|"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" `jump` | `[]` | ProxyJump chain, independent auth per hop |\n| `readyTimeout` `keepaliveInterval` `k"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"eepaliveCountMax` | 45000 / 0 / 3 | milliseconds |\n| `strictHostKeyChecking` `knownHosts` | false / "},{"id":"p13s5","text":"`[]` | host-key verification |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"> **Web profile:** `subprocess` and `fs` are single-slot services. Disable the local providers (`dsh"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"-subprocess-local`, `dsh-fs-sandbox`) in the profile patch, or remote work silently runs on the harn"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"ss-local`, `dsh-fs-sandbox`) in the profile patch, or remote work silently runs on the harness host."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Limitations"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- Remote pid is always `-1`; `terminate` doesn't reap descendants (SSH can't).\n- The SSH link doesn'"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"t auto-reconnect after a drop — recreate the connection.\n- `streamText` is text-only; remote session"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"s aren't added to the local workspace registry."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
